Copyright 2026 Ross Haugh

This project runs clink, the author's own stream engine
(https://github.com/orhaugh/clink, Apache License 2.0), from its runtime image
ghcr.io/orhaugh/clink-runtime, pinned by digest in rebuild.sh. clink is not
included in this repository. The image is built from clink's main branch at
commit c134524d, which is not a release.

It uses Relate by Neo4j (https://github.com/relatedb/relate, Apache License
2.0): the relate-db Python package, installed from PyPI, and, inside clink's
image, Relate's C library, both at version 1.0.1. Neither is included in this
repository.

The agent uses the Anthropic Python SDK (Apache License 2.0), installed from
PyPI. Other Python dependencies are listed with their hashes in
requirements.txt and are installed, not redistributed.
